[iog]
<i>"Infinte power is impossible...but this comes close"<br>
--Guardian of the Isle of Geysers</i>
<p>
There have been many who have had the Isle of Geysers in their hands...many of them Guardians.  They were sworn to protect the Isle from anyone who wished to use it's power.  They knew well of how dangerous the Guardianship is...for they are the target for many attacks.  Although no one truly understands the power of the Isle, one thing is certain: it's ability to attract vast amounts of storm power.  

